<title>USA: Engineered hires firm, seeks acquisition.</title>
<headline>Engineered hires firm, seeks acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineered Support Systems Inc said Thursday it retained Quarterdeck Investment Partners Inc to indentify and evaluate potential acquisition candidates.</p>
<p>The company said in a release that its objective is to acquire a defense company within the next year, which would provide top-line growth and be accretive to earnings.</p>
<p>Quarterdeck is an investment banking firm specializing in the aerospace and defense industries.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
